Comment:
 This package is built by the Plate|Fold project from its own release build.
 The desktop program links the system's WebKitGTK. The command-line tool and
 the export worker are a frozen Python application that carries its own
 Python runtime, Python libraries, shared libraries and a Chromium headless
 shell under /usr/lib/PlateFold/runtime. Each bundled component keeps its own
 license, listed below; the license files named here are installed with it.

